     "text": "The Nancy Grace Roman Space Telescope has launched - The Planetary Society\n\nhttps://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxOSnNvdmdRT0hkNWNIOUNtaGRtRzQ5R182TGVkUHU4bmowZlVWR0pfbEhYODRrb05MeHA2QXdZdGI4VGgtejFOa2FUVkdqa2Raa1hNanBNNXF5bmxISnFrUk5laVpJQUpHelhTTEJtbTkyWjdXWV9tQUVBamszOWJmSVZvNUJqQQ?oc=5\n\nThe Nancy Grace Roman Space Telescope has launched The Planetary Society\n\n--\nPublished: 2026-08-30T12:22:29+00:00\nPublisher: The Planetary Society\nSearch: 'Space missions and astronomy — what launched, what was found' through Google News search\nEntry id (guid): CBMihgFBVV95cUxOSnNvdmdRT0hkNWNIOUNtaGRtRzQ5R182TGVkUHU4bmowZlVWR0pfbEhYODRrb05MeHA2QXdZdGI4VGgtejFOa2FUVkdqa2Raa1hNanBNNXF5bmxISnFrUk5laVpJQUpHelhTTEJtbTkyWjdXWV9tQUVBamszOWJmSVZvNUJqQQ\n",
