     "text": "Newly selected NASA mission will hunt for caves on the Moon - Astronomy Magazine\n\nhttps://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxOcXpXa2I2Yjd5aklKZElpVUJkaEU2TXpNTENrM2Z1My1VMnF4S1Rkd1NQZHFXQWw1Tmc3QVJ0am5iTUNnelNDVDdRN3dtZEJiY0tBVWY4Z0k1Q01Uck9XeHI4TWExd0Z2My1oQlhxanA0XzdBdzFnX3JTaUp3OFNQclVza25uZjhuN3BMMDNLd2doOFAwbkJiR0tR?oc=5\n\nNewly selected NASA mission will hunt for caves on the Moon Astronomy Magazine\n\n--\nPublished: 2026-10-09T07:00:00+00:00\nPublisher: Astronomy Magazine\nSearch: 'Space missions and astronomy — what launched, what was found' through Google News search\nEntry id (guid): CBMimgFBVV95cUxOcXpXa2I2Yjd5aklKZElpVUJkaEU2TXpNTENrM2Z1My1VMnF4S1Rkd1NQZHFXQWw1Tmc3QVJ0am5iTUNnelNDVDdRN3dtZEJiY0tBVWY4Z0k1Q01Uck9XeHI4TWExd0Z2My1oQlhxanA0XzdBdzFnX3JTaUp3OFNQclVza25uZjhuN3BMMDNLd2doOFAwbkJiR0tR\n",
